	(text_box "With MODE[2:0] = 111, the PHY is configured to be all capable with auto-negotiation enabled.\n\nWith LED1/REGOFF floating, the internal 1.2 V regulator is enabled and LED1/REGOFF functions as LED1 (Link Activity).\n\nWith LED2/~{INTSEL} floating, ~{INT}/REFCLKO is an active low interrupt output and the 50 MHz REF_CLK is sourced externally on the XTAL1/CLKIN pin and LED2/~{INTSEL} functions as LED2 (Link Speed)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 163.83 222.25 0)
		(size 101.6 19.05)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
